            subtitle: 'The Cross-Layout Block Game',
            tagline: 'Doubles open four ways. More ends, more options, more chaos.',
          },
          shortDescription: "Block Dominoes with a cross-shaped twist. The first double becomes a 'spinner' â€” playable on all four sides. This creates 4 open ends instead of 2, dramatically increasing options. Some play with all doubles as spinners, creating wild branching layouts.",
