        prompts: {
          human: 'The 6-6 spinner has been played on both long sides and one short side. Three open ends show: 3, 5, and 6 (the empty short side). You hold 6-2, 5-1, 3-3, and 4-4. Playing the 3-3 on the 3-end would open ANOTHER spinner if all-doubles-spin. Do you want more ends?',
          ai: "Game: Block Dominoes with Spinners. Double-six set. 2-4 players. First double = spinner (play on all 4 sides). Pass if can't play (block). Variant: single spinner vs all-spinners. Score by pip difference. Game to 61 or 101.",
